  "sourceTitle": "Armenian Style Potato Dish",
  "sourceText": "Armenian Style Potato Dish\nBy: Carrie Barr\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 5:22pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/8 cup peanut oil\n4 1/2 cups raw diced potatoes\n4 tablespoons tomato paste or puree\n1/2 cup water\n1 teaspoon salt\n1 teaspoon paprika\n1 small onion, chopped fine\n1 tablespoon dry minced parsley\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all together and place in a greased casserole dish. 2 Bake for 1 hour at 350°F (175°C) or until potatoes are tender and top is golden brown.",
  "parsedSource": {
